<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 17.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 17.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.01    2.17</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld     15.69    5.10</p>
<p> 3   Bk of Queen	    13.28    6.10</p>
<p> 4   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.87    2.30</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.80    1.00</p>
